<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE AT 1.5PCT.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE AT 1.5PCT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's central bank said on Monday that its 31-day deposit rate remained stable at 1.5 percent.</p>
<p>The bank will accept deposits at this rate on July 7 and the repayment will take place on August 7, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
